{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About:<br><br>The Evil Mouse</strong> is a short psychological horror game about guilt, memories, and facing what you\u2019ve tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a strange program on your computer. Inside, a girl named Lucy asks for your help to escape a house controlled by <i>the evil mouse</i>. Lucy drags you into the game, and as you search for the truth, the line between game and reality begins to break.<br><br><u>Takes about 20 - 25 minutes to play through.</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958510?t=1762376967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958510?t=1762376967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958510/4e612e65b8968d82d3c35a0f03d8a03de0b6d822/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762376967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958510/4e612e65b8968d82d3c35a0f03d8a03de0b6d822/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762376967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About:<br><br>The Evil Mouse</strong> is a short psychological horror game about guilt, memories, and facing what you\u2019ve tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a strange program on your computer. Inside, a girl named Lucy asks for your help to escape a house controlled by <i>the evil mouse</i>. Lucy drags you into the game, and as you search for the truth, the line between game and reality begins to break.<br><br><u>Takes about 20 - 25 minutes to play through.</u></p>","developers":["Thorleif Owe"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958510/f171